#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:96
msgid ""
"This pass transforms vectorized global memory loads and stores (using Ramp "
"indices) into explicit ldg32/64/128/256 and stg32/64/128/256 intrinsics for "
"better codegen."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:99
msgid ""
"Key behaviors: - Converts Ramp-based global BufferLoad to ldg intrinsics - "
"Converts Ramp-based global BufferStore to stg intrinsics - Supports "
"predicated loads (if_then_else with else=0) - Supports predicated stores (if "
"in then case) - Skips loads in async scope (will be lowered to cp.async) - "
"Only enabled for CUDA targets"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:126
msgid ""
"Inject tcgen05.fence::before_thread_sync / after_thread_sync at conservative "
"TCGEN05/TMEM synchronization boundaries on Blackwell (SM100+) targets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:130
msgid ""
"The current pass wraps CTA-wide shared-memory syncs and also inserts fences "
"around linear mbarrier wait/use and use/arrive handoff patterns. It is "
"intentionally conservative and does not try to infer arbitrary barrier "
"protocols."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/cuda/transform/index.rst:143
msgid ""
"This pass analyzes the function to collect register hints from set_max_nreg "
"and no_set_max_nreg calls, then injects appropriate set_max_nreg calls into "
"producer and consumer branches of warp-specialized code."
msgstr ""
